rooms_desc ({"  You have just entered the home of Bido, the Golden One.  As you look around you recognize the faces of other great Jedi Knights.  Faces such as Annakin Skywalker, his son Luke, and his daughter Leia.  There are also pictures of the teachers of the mystic arts of the Jedi.  Faces such as Obi Wan Kenobi and Yoda fill this section.  You feel very comfortable here in this place because you know that you are well protected here.   For if Bido is not here, he soon will be...","You seem to have just entered the trophy room of Bido, the Golden One.On either side of the room there are two glass cases containing various items,that tell the tale of the training of the young Bido's training.  In the very back of this Large room you see Bido's quite old and quite well preserved Incom T-65 Space Superiority Fighter, or as most of you might recognize, the X-wing.  In the glass case to your right, you find yourattention caught by some interesting looking old clothing, something similarto what a farmer might wear, if he lived on Tatooine.  On a shelf above this, you notice a familiar sight to those of you who know of the legends of the Jedi.It appears to be a very crude model of the handle that you notice that Bidoalways carries.  It looks like it might even be his first!  Next to that is the utility belt that as of late, he has seen fit to lay aside.  You wonderwhat might be in such a small compartment  In the second case, the one to your left, you notice a head!  No, it just looked like a head for a minute there, whew!  It is actually a helmet.It is a leering black helmet with large eyes and a triangular grill for a mouth.Perhaps you have seen this before somewhere.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Bido's sanctorium","Bido's Trophy Room","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
